 on Thu, 23 Aug 2001 15:07:16 +0200.
 .
 It was downloaded from ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/system/security
 (original site is at http://www.net.tamu.edu/ftp/security/TAMU
 more information at http://www.net.tamu.edu/network/tools/tiger.html)
 .
 The software is currently maintained in Savannah and available at
 https://savannah.nongnu.org/projects/tiger/
 .
 The TARA version which has been also integrated in this package 
 (even if the name of the upstream source has not been changed) is
 available for download from http://www.arsc.com
 .
